Package: CerebroNexus
Title: Interactive Visualization of Single-Cell and Spatial Transcriptomics
Version: 8.0.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Michael", "Heming", email = "mihem@mailbox.org", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9568-2790")),
  person("Roman", "Hillje", email = "roman.hillje@googlemail.com", role = c("aut")),
  person("Xuesong", "Wang", email = "wangxuesong29@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cph"))
  )
Description: Interactive 'Shiny' application for exploring and sharing
    single-cell and spatial transcriptomics data, extending 'Cerebro'
    (Hillje et al. (2020) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btz877>). Data from
    'Seurat', 'SingleCellExperiment', 'AnnData', 'MuData' or 'SpatialData'
    objects are converted into a portable data file that can be browsed with
    coordinated views of gene expression, immune repertoires, trajectories,
    spatial images and HLA-TCR motifs. A point-and-click builder creates
    these files and standalone apps for deployment on a 'Shiny' server.
URL: https://mihem.github.io/CerebroNexus/,
    https://github.com/mihem/CerebroNexus
BugReports: https://github.com/mihem/CerebroNexus/issues
